        "paragraph_id": "1B219980",
        "text": "XBeach iterates until a minimum threshold difference between iterations is found for Equation (B.14) and (B.15). Infiltration in one time step is limited to the amount of surface water available in the cell and to the amount of water required to raise the groundwater level to the level of the bed:"
