        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1885,
        "paragraph_id": "7C2E648C",
        "text": "If during infiltration the groundwater level reaches the bed level, the fraction of the time step required to do so is estimated [see (B.17)] and the remaining fraction is used in the submarine exchange."
